# OmniPaxos (1,2,1) without a time limit (owner 2026-11-09 09:10): the 48 h export of the same size on brain05 will be cut at its limit; this copy starts when that row has stopped (node-side waiter). Joins against S_raft and S_omni, whose exports exist on brain05.
C3E.omnipaxos.impl_correct_1_2_1_fifo.t16.cinf 250 8640000 "$DAAVAR"/scripts/rust-run.sh omnipaxos export impl --out export.jsonl --threads 16 --model fifo -- correct 1 2 1
